### 学生提交评价
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 3,
  "orderItemId": 2,
  "dishId": 1,
  "rating": 5,
  "content": "味道很好，宫保鸡丁很下饭，值得推荐！"
}

### 1. 学生查询自己的评价
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/my?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 2. 查询宫保鸡丁的公开评价（审核前）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/dish/1?page=1&size=10

### 3. 管理员查询所有评价
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/reviews?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 4. 管理员查询待审核评价
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/reviews?page=1&size=10&status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 5. 管理员审核通过评价1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/reviews/1/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "APPROVED"
}

### 5. 管理员审核通过评价1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/reviews/1/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "APPROVED"
}

### 7. 重复提交同一订单明细的评价
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 3,
  "orderItemId": 2,
  "dishId": 1,
  "rating": 5,
  "content": "重复评价测试"
}

### 审核通过后查询宫保鸡丁评价
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/dish/1?page=1&size=10

